          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s77j",
          "text": "If you’ve been injured in a recent truck accident in Thornton, Colorado, you may need an attorney to help you get through the recovery process. A Thornton truck accident attorney will work for you through every stage of your case, answering your questions and guiding you through legal matters with tailored advice. At Dormer Harpring, LLC, we’ve been helping crash survivors and family members recover for many years. Find out how we can help you today.",
