      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s77x",
          "text": "The Importance of Hiring an Accident Attorney",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b780",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s77z",
          "text": "Hiring a truck accident lawyer to represent you during a claim can vastly change the outcome of your case, as well as your overall legal experience. An attorney can take care of all of the complex and challenging aspects of your case while you focus on recovering. Hiring a Thornton truck accident lawyer can come with important advantages such as professional crash investigation, connections to qualified experts, and experienced claim negotiators working on your behalf. With a lawyer in your corner, you can go up against insurance claims adjusters, defend your legal rights as a victim and demand the financial compensation that you deserve.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b782",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s781",
          "text": "What to Do After a Truck Accident in Thornton?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b784",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s783",
          "text": "Although truck accidents happen every day, most truck accident victims never expect to be involved in this type of crash. It can be difficult to remain calm and take the steps that are necessary to protect your rights after this type of crash. If you can, however, try to take the following actions:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b786",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s785",
          "text": "Pullover and call 911 to report the accident.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b788",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s787",
          "text": "If you’re injured, seek immediate medical treatment.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b78a",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s789",
          "text": "Identify the other parties involved and get their information.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b78c",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s78b",
          "text": "Do not admit fault for the truck accident.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b78e",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s78d",
          "text": "Check for witnesses at or near the scene of the collision.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b78g",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s78f",
          "text": "Document the accident by taking pictures and writing down what happened.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b78i",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s78h",
          "text": "File an insurance claim with the trucking company’s insurance provider.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b78k",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s78j",
          "text": "Be careful when speaking to an insurance claims adjuster about your truck accident.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b78m",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s78l",
          "text": "Do not sign anything sent to you from the insurance company.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b78o",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s78n",
          "text": "Contact a truck accident attorney in Thornton for assistance before settling.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b78t",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l78q",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/thornton-personal-injury-attorney/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s78p",
          "text": "Knowing what to do and what not to do after a truck accident in Thornton can give you greater peace of mind. Even if you cannot perform all of these actions after a truck accident, you can be eligible for financial compensation. A ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s78r",
          "text": "personal injury attorney in Thornton",
          "marks": [
            "l78q"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s78s",
          "text": " can help you build a compelling claim even if you could not take all of these steps.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b78v",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s78u",
          "text": "How Are Truck Accidents Different From Other Auto Accidents?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b78x",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s78w",
          "text": "It is important not to treat a truck accident in Thornton like a regular car accident. Collisions involving commercial trucks and 18-wheelers are unique in many different ways. A truck accident case is more complex than a normal auto accident case for many reasons:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b78z",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s78y",
          "text": "Vicarious liability. A legal doctrine that can make a trucking company responsible for a crash caused by a driver or employee.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b791",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s790",
          "text": "Severe damage. The injuries, losses and property damage caused by a truck accident are generally more severe than in a typical collision.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b793",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s792",
          "text": "Rapid response teams. Trucking companies often send people to the scene immediately to gather and remove crucial evidence.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b795",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s794",
          "text": "Time-sensitive evidence. It is important to collect evidence as soon as possible, including the truck’s black box, employment records from the trucking company, video surveillance footage from traffic cameras, electronic logging device records and cell phone records.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b797",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s796",
          "text": "The size of the adversary. You may not be going up against just another driver; instead, your case may involve a powerful trucking company and its aggressive lawyers.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b799",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s798",
          "text": "As a crash victim who is seeking a financial recovery, it is critical to recognize these differences and respond accordingly. Rather than handling your claim on your own, you may wish to hire a truck accident lawyer in Thornton to help you with the complex legal process.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b79b",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s79a",
          "text": "Trucking Industry Regulations",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
