      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7an",
          "text": "All of these types of collisions have the potential to be catastrophic. Identifying the type of truck accident can help investigators determine the cause of the crash.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7aq",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ap",
          "text": "Common Causes of Truck Accidents",
