        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7as",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ar",
          "text": "Almost all truck accidents in Colorado can be prevented. They are caused most often by careless and reckless parties, such as negligent truck drivers. Common causes of truck accidents include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
