        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ce",
          "text": "If you were involved in a truck accident in Thornton, Colorado, our attorneys can help you understand and protect your rights as a victim. We will identify your goals and pursue them using proven legal strategies for the best possible outcome. If we don’t win your case, we won’t charge any legal fees – guaranteed. Learn more about our services during a free case consultation. ",
